[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0010","text":"────\n要分享的就这些了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0020","text":"明白"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0030","text":"……对了对了\n那张照片反响还挺大的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0040","text":"你看，围着爱依的那张……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0050","text":"啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0060","text":"手段，是手段……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0070","text":"当时也不知道排名会变成什么样……\n那时候，不那样做不行吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0080","text":"哈哈，也许是这样……\n但即便如此，能拍到那样的照片我真的很开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0090","text":"先说好，那种事\n就那一次了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0100","text":"……！　抱歉，冬优子\n我去接个电话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0110","text":"……请便"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0120","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0130","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0140","text":"抱歉！\n让你久等了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0150","text":"冬优子？\n在看什么────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0160","text":"──────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0170","text":"没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_04_0180","text":"～～～～～\n什么都……！"}]
